#59000
&+LAtop An &+mA&+Lncient Spiral Staircase&N~
&+L   Two flawless &+Chuman &+Wskulls&+L sit at the top of the long wooden rails
&+Lleading into the C&+ra&+Lt&+ra&+Lc&+ro&+Lmbs of &+rRavenloft.&+L  There are only myths told
&+Lof this dark and ancient place that are even forbidden to speak of
&+Lin some lands, but they are mostly fiction.  The darkness here is
&+Lintense, without a single whisper of sound and only a black void
&+Lleading below.  What lies on the bottom of the twisted stone steps
&+Lhas been here for a very long time.  &+LA winding ledge along the
&+Lwall's edge of the staircase has small pits containing aged remnants
&+Lof a &+rfire place&+L.  A devastating &+gstench&+L penetrates all mortal nostrils
&+Lfrom the abyssal void below.
~
