#59001
&+LAn A&+mnc&+Lient Spiral Staircase&N~
   &+LTwo long bone railings sit on opposite walls of this long,
&+Lancient stone spiral staircase leading into the deepest depths
&+Lof Castle Ravenloft.  This staircase is quite large, and able
&+Lto accomodate several humanoids at once in both directions,
&+Land seems to be quite heavily-travelled due to the smoothness
&+Lof the stone steps, the darkened burned marks on the walls
&+Lbearing the once-lit torch sconces that illuminated this
&+Lnow pitch-black passage.  A horrific stench violates the air.
~
