#59052
&+LA Huge, Forgotten &+mStorage Hall&N~
   &+LThis huge hall sits deep within the bowels of Castle Ravenloft, and
&+Lis utterly filled with spider-webs, dust, and a menacing magical
&+Ldarkness.  Huge ancient wine racks line the west and northern walls,
&+Lwhile stacked wooden crates line the east and southern walls.
&+LThe entire area is caked in a thick layer of dust and the air smells
&+Llike it has not reached mortal nostrils in decades.  Sconces on the
&+Lwalls hold no torches, and there are no other signs of light or life
&+Lin the area, outside of the putrid magic.
~
