&+bA Partially-Submerged &+LDungeon Tunnel&N~
&+L   This dark and unforgiving tunnel is partially flooded with standing water.
&+LThe blocked stone of these dungeon walls contain cell-blocks to the north and
&+Lsouth, with a dark torturers chamber to the far west.  Thick spiderwebs hang
&+Lfrom all parts of the ceiling.  The putrid water, only about waist deep, is
&+Lfull of old &+Wbones&+L, &+Rrags&+L, and floating islands of &+yfilth&+L.
   &+LOccasionally deep low moaning can be heard from the south.  The tunnel
&+Lseems to be at a slant to the west, where the water level rises.
~
