&+Lfive foot rectangular slab of marble sits at the center of the
&+Lcrypt. A rag-draped skeleton reclines at the center of the slab.
&+LOne of the skeleton's hands, gribbed to its chest, tightly holds
&+Lthe neck of a bottle.
   &+BAdrian Selymes was the lord vintner to the Zarovich kings for
&+Ba hundred years. His long life was attributed to the nearly
&+Bsupernatural wines he was capable of producing in his secret
&+Bwinery. Adrian learned his techniques by studying similar super-
&+Bnatural vintages the world over. No one knew wine as well as Adrian.
~
