&nA Mountain Clearing of &+GP&+go&+Gr&+gt&+Ga&+gl&+Gs &NOverlooking &+rThe Blood &+mRift&N~
   &+LJagged, impassable mountain peaks stretch up in all directions from this
&+msmall, sandy clearing high up in the tallest mountain of the Blood Rift.
&+LShifts in the black, smokey clouds reveal the landscale below - a twisting
&+mchaos of mountains and rivers branching off from a great flow of blood
&+Lpouring in from the Nine Hells, above, through the Blood Rift and splitting
&+mthrough the Abyss and other fiendish planes via massive falls that flow
&+Lupwards and downwards. This particular clearing amidst one of the Blood Rifts
&+mhighest mountains is full of unstable green portals that seem to be open and
&+Lclosing with a will of their own. The gravity has a strange angular pull,
&+mcreating a disorienting sensation. The shrieking of tortured lesser yugoloths
&+Lcan be heard echoing from within the mountains.
~
