#59188
&+LIn the &+bC&+mr&+by&+mp&+bt &+Lof &+BKing Ignatie Kazaku~
  This small 10-foot hollow crypt is dark and dreary, full of
the toxic fog that plagues the catacombs.  A huge three foot by
five foot rectangular slab of marble sits at the center of the
crypt with no remains in sight.
   &+BAlthough he was a trusted soverign, Kazaku was known more
&+Bfor his inventions, as he spent a great deal more of his time
&+Bin his workshop than in halls - its location secret to this
&+Bday. Most people assumed Kazaku had a demonic advisor chained
&+Bin his secret workshop, for whenever he returned from a month-
&+Blong invention binge, he'd have a strange yet elegant device
&+Bclutched under his arm.
~
