&+LA thick, &+Gt&+gox&+Gic &+gf&+Go&+gg&+L fills the air with a stench of &+mundeath&+L as it
&+Lclings to the floor throughout.  &nCobwebs&+L hang limp in the musty
&+Lair, while the floor is covered in ancient &+Wbones&+L and bat &+mguano&+L.
